@prefix sfcore: <https://streamfind.dev/catalogue/core#> .
@prefix sf: <https://streamfind.dev/vocabulary#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

sfcore:streamfind
    a sf:Domain ;
    skos:inScheme sfcore:scheme ;
    skos:prefLabel "streamfind" ;
    skos:definition "Generic streamfind project contract." ;
    sf:guidance "Project entry points: call create once with database_path to create a DuckDB-backed project, then use get_operations and get_operation to discover canonical workflow operations and their schemas. Build a persisted operation graph with add_operation and connect_operations, or submit the complete graph with set_workflow. Each operation node carries its parameters; connections bind typed output ports to typed input ports. Call validate_workflow before run_workflow, then inspect get_artifact_inventory and returned structured results. Every project tool call carries database_path; no method discovery or session connection is needed for the operation-graph workflow." .
